1
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:48,000
You look quite pretty.

2
00:01:49,930 --> 00:01:50,900
Miss.

3
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:52,830
What are you doing squatting here?

4
00:01:52,900 --> 00:01:54,500
With such a beautiful face,

5
00:01:54,729 --> 00:01:56,900
it's a pity to squat on the street corner.

6
00:01:56,900 --> 00:01:58,000
Looking for work.

7
00:02:06,730 --> 00:02:09,330
Looking for work? What a coincidence.

8
00:02:09,430 --> 00:02:10,930
I'm short of hands.

9
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,800
Room and board included,

10
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:14,560
and the work is easy.

11
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:17,490
You just sit on the stage and sing a few songs at night.

12
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:21,300
People will applaud you from below.

13
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:22,160
How decent.

14
00:02:24,329 --> 00:02:25,460
Singing?

15
00:02:33,329 --> 00:02:34,160
Oh my.

16
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:37,460
You must be starving, little girl.

17
00:02:37,730 --> 00:02:38,660
Come.

18
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:41,020
Sanniang will make you some noodles.

19
00:03:09,930 --> 00:03:11,130
This is a brothel.

20
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,800
Don't make it sound so bad, miss.

21
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,620
We call this Yichun Pavilion,

22
00:03:15,830 --> 00:03:17,060
an elegant place.

23
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:19,660
Today is Sanniang's special auction.

24
00:03:19,660 --> 00:03:20,329
Gentlemen.

25
00:03:20,430 --> 00:03:22,329
This girl is new here.

26
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:23,600
She's fresh,

27
00:03:23,630 --> 00:03:24,760
and still a virgin.

28
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:26,800
Hahaha.

29
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:34,500
Are you crazy?

30
00:03:34,500 --> 00:03:36,660
Didn't you say room and board were included?

31
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:37,660
Yes.

32
00:03:37,660 --> 00:03:39,260
Room and board are included.

33
00:03:39,730 --> 00:03:40,930
But miss,

34
00:03:40,930 --> 00:03:43,500
you have to earn some money back for Sanniang.

35
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,260
Gentlemen.

36
00:03:45,260 --> 00:03:47,760
The starting price is fifty taels.

37
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:48,800
Sixty taels.

38
00:03:50,100 --> 00:03:50,960
Seventy taels.

39
00:03:54,130 --> 00:03:55,460
Let go of me, both of you.

40
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:58,460
Otherwise, don't cry when I kick you later.

41
00:03:58,730 --> 00:04:00,900
Save your energy, miss.

42
00:04:01,230 --> 00:04:03,230
You still have to serve the gentlemen later.

43
00:04:03,230 --> 00:04:04,060
Fine.

44
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,100
Just you wait.

45
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:09,020
One hundred and twenty taels going once.

46
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:12,130
One hundred and twenty taels going twice.

47
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:16,800
One hundred and fifty taels.

48
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,620
What are you shouting for?

49
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:29,900
I'm bidding one hundred and fifty taels for myself.

50
00:04:31,130 --> 00:04:32,800
I'm buying myself.

51
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:36,260
Miss, where did you get the silver?

52
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:37,730
I don't have any money on me,

53
00:04:37,730 --> 00:04:40,100
but I can cook, fight, and scold people.

54
00:04:40,130 --> 00:04:41,130
If you buy me,

55
00:04:41,130 --> 00:04:42,730
I'll work for you for the rest of my life to pay off the debt.

56
00:04:42,730 --> 00:04:44,930
It's better than selling me to any of these bald guys down here.

57
00:04:44,930 --> 00:04:47,560
Hahaha.

58
00:04:52,260 --> 00:04:54,100
Drag her down,

59
00:04:54,260 --> 00:04:55,990
and send her to the Tianzi room.

60
00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:57,330
Who she serves tonight,

61
00:04:57,330 --> 00:04:58,460
I have the final say.

62
00:05:00,930 --> 00:05:02,530
Hua Sanniang, just you wait.

63
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:14,300
Miss.

64
00:05:14,300 --> 00:05:15,800
One hundred and twenty taels.

65
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,600
Worth it.

66
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,530
Really worth it.

67
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,630
Don't rush.

68
00:05:22,930 --> 00:05:24,000
It'll be ready soon.

69
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,130
It'll be ready soon.

70
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,490
Don't come over.

71
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:32,900
Why are you running?

72
00:05:32,900 --> 00:05:34,159
Get lost. Get lost.

73
00:05:34,159 --> 00:05:35,060
Come,

74
00:05:35,060 --> 00:05:36,330
let me give you a kiss.

75
00:05:36,330 --> 00:05:37,159
Just one kiss.

76
00:05:37,159 --> 00:05:37,760
Go away.

77
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:40,060
Little beauty,

78
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,830
let me kiss you.

79
00:05:41,830 --> 00:05:43,890
That's one hundred and twenty taels.

80
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,930
Did I come at a bad time?

81
00:05:55,100 --> 00:05:56,600
Ouch!

82
00:05:57,460 --> 00:05:58,560
Who is it?

83
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:00,060
Who the hell let him in?

84
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,200
Sir.

85
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,700
Your forehead is dark.

86
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:08,060
You will suffer a bloody disaster tonight.

87
00:06:08,300 --> 00:06:09,960
Where did this filthy Taoist come from?

88
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,730
I paid for this girl.

89
00:06:11,860 --> 00:06:12,560
You...

90
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:19,260
Th-Thank you, Taoist priest.

91
00:06:21,460 --> 00:06:22,430
Hurry up and leave.

92
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:23,700
When the madam brings her men up later,

93
00:06:23,700 --> 00:06:25,030
I can't fight that many people.

94
00:06:25,030 --> 00:06:25,800
Go, go.
